00:28:09,420 --> 00:28:11,299
get down there.

501
00:28:11,299 --> 00:28:12,139
What do you see?

502
00:28:12,139 --> 00:28:14,099
Chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk.

503
00:28:14,099 --> 00:28:19,099
Chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk-chk.

504
00:28:19,460 --> 00:28:22,859
Wait, you hear nothing.

505
00:28:22,859 --> 00:28:25,539
I go to the bottom and it's just a bunch of cogs

506
00:28:25,539 --> 00:28:27,220
and fucking springs and shit.

507
00:28:27,220 --> 00:28:29,019
I feel like, God damn it.

508
00:28:29,019 --> 00:28:30,180
I wasn't gonna break them,

509
00:28:30,180 --> 00:28:31,019
but if you wanna break them, that's fine.

510
00:28:31,180 --> 00:28:32,019
I'm joking.

511
00:28:32,019 --> 00:28:33,539
No, I don't want them to break.

512
00:28:33,539 --> 00:28:35,779
I just figured that's what would happen.

513
00:28:35,779 --> 00:28:36,619
Yeah.

514
00:28:38,019 --> 00:28:39,099
Well, we haven't established

515
00:28:39,099 --> 00:28:41,700
that you can communicate with Cogsworth

516
00:28:41,700 --> 00:28:45,619
and it is a spiral staircase.

517
00:28:46,660 --> 00:28:48,379
So I don't think there's anything

518
00:28:48,379 --> 00:28:52,579
that you gain from that, specifically.

519
00:28:52,579 --> 00:28:54,779
I mean, I'm gonna go towards those stairs.

520
00:28:54,779 --> 00:28:56,420
I've been saying. Absolutely.

521
00:28:56,420 --> 00:28:57,259
Yeah.

522
00:28:57,259 --> 00:28:59,339
I'm just debating whether or not it's wide enough

523
00:28:59,340 --> 00:29:01,420
for me to pull my weapon out comfortably.

524
00:29:04,100 --> 00:29:05,700
Sounds good.

525
00:29:05,700 --> 00:29:08,900
My homunculus obeys my commands.

526
00:29:08,900 --> 00:29:10,180
Yeah.

527
00:29:10,180 --> 00:29:11,460
Communicate with me.

528
00:29:11,460 --> 00:29:13,780
Doesn't talk, though. That's the command.

529
00:29:13,780 --> 00:29:14,620
Right?

530
00:29:14,620 --> 00:29:15,460
Damn it. Talk to me.

531
00:29:15,460 --> 00:29:16,780
What if you commanded to talk?

532
00:29:16,780 --> 00:29:17,620
Exactly.

533
00:29:17,620 --> 00:29:18,460
Yeah.

534
00:29:19,900 --> 00:29:21,620
You talk now. Done.

535
00:29:22,580 --> 00:29:26,020
Ooh, maybe you can do some mechanical fuckery

536
00:29:26,020 --> 00:29:28,820
like I did arcane fuckery and make it a voice box.

537
00:29:28,819 --> 00:29:29,659
Yeah.

538
00:29:30,619 --> 00:29:32,019
She did just throw it down the stairs.

539
00:29:32,019 --> 00:29:34,019
I did, just, yeah.

540
00:29:34,019 --> 00:29:36,179
Somebody poisoned the well.

541
00:29:36,179 --> 00:29:37,939
It understands language and you speak,

542
00:29:37,939 --> 00:29:38,779
it doesn't speak.

543
00:29:38,779 --> 00:29:40,539
It's immune to poison.

544
00:29:43,700 --> 00:29:44,579
Sorry.

545
00:29:44,579 --> 00:29:46,099
No, okay, I sent him down,

546
00:29:46,099 --> 00:29:49,019
but I'm gonna have to go get him.

547
00:29:50,779 --> 00:29:51,859
I'll lead the way

548
00:29:51,859 --> 00:29:54,779
and I'm gonna draw my rapier just in case

549
00:29:54,779 --> 00:29:57,859
and lead with the pointy end going forward

550
00:29:57,860 --> 00:29:58,900
as I walk down.

551
00:30:00,100 --> 00:30:01,660
Okay.

552
00:30:01,660 --> 00:30:04,700
I mean, I'll take my weapon out too.

553
00:30:04,700 --> 00:30:07,540
Little sling shot.

554
00:30:07,540 --> 00:30:10,500
You head down the stairwell

555
00:30:10,500 --> 00:30:15,180
and the stairs end beneath a low stone arch.

556
00:30:15,180 --> 00:30:18,300
That warm lamp light that you assumed,

557
00:30:18,300 --> 00:30:20,260
it continues to glow ahead,

558
00:30:20,260 --> 00:30:21,660
though from what you can see,

559
00:30:21,660 --> 00:30:24,740
no flame burns anywhere that you can see.

560
00:30:25,740 --> 00:30:27,059
The further down you go,

561
00:30:27,059 --> 00:30:29,339
that mechanical grinding sound

562
00:30:29,339 --> 00:30:32,339
that you've heard throughout the building gets louder.

563
00:30:32,339 --> 00:30:37,220
You hear copper pipes tick softly inside the walls,

564
00:30:38,339 --> 00:30:42,940
belts turning from somewhere within the space.

565
00:30:44,140 --> 00:30:46,740
You step through this low stone arch

566
00:30:46,740 --> 00:30:50,059
and you see that shelves of labeled parts

567
00:30:50,059 --> 00:30:52,140
stand in exact rows.

568
00:30:54,779 --> 00:30:59,460
There are five different passageways

569
00:30:59,460 --> 00:31:01,940
in this space that you've entered.

570
00:31:01,940 --> 00:31:04,779
And beside the first entrance that you can see

571
00:31:04,779 --> 00:31:07,779
off to your left, you see a brass plaque

572
00:31:07,779 --> 00:31:12,099
that reads, continuity requires care.

573
00:31:16,059 --> 00:31:20,259
The mechanical sound begins to chug from within this

574
00:31:20,259 --> 00:31:22,620
and you hear grinding of the gears.

575
00:31:23,540 --> 00:31:25,500
Do you know it really grinds my gears?

576
00:31:25,500 --> 00:31:26,660
I hear the grinding.

577
00:31:26,660 --> 00:31:27,660
I hear the grinding.

